# The page's source is checked out with LF on every machine. The build record (streamstudio/canvas/.built-from) is a
# fingerprint of these files' BYTES (streamstudio.page.fingerprint): a checkout that turned LF into CRLF (git on
# Windows, core.autocrlf) would find the committed page out of date. Binary files are left as they are.
* text=auto eol=lf
